<title>USA: Bay Meadows/California Jockey Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Bay Meadows/California Jockey Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months    Ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenue				   $12,195,000    $13,144,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			 (608,000)	1,071,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per paired share    ($0.11)	  ($0.19)</p>
<p>			   For the Nine Months	Ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenue				    41,774,000     30,198,000</p>
<p> Net income				  2,461,000	1,978,000</p>
<p> Net income per paired share		$0.42	   $0.34</p>
<p>NOTES: On October 31, California Jockey Club and Bay Meadows Operating Co entered a binding acquisition with Patriot American Hospitality Inc. The companies' boards approved the agreement, which remains subject to approval by Patriot American shareholders and the paired shareholders of California Jockey Club and Bay Meadows Operating Co.</p>
</text>
